{
  "interfaces": [
    {
      "id": "hypothesis-blueprint:field-contract:2",
      "name": "hypothesis-blueprint",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "topic": "research-artifacts",
      "producer": "Hypothesis CC (research.hypothesis)",
      "consumers": [
        "Builder",
        "Benchmark",
        "Evaluation",
        "checking"
      ],
      "document": "capsules/hypothesis.md#output-field-contract",
      "fields": {
        "schema_version": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Format version 2.0.0"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Immutable record identity"
        },
        "brief_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Accepted Brief"
        },
        "opportunity_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Selected opportunity card"
        },
        "claim": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "One testable claim, one sentence, 20 to 300 characters"
        },
        "mechanism": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Proposed causal mechanism, 10 to 500 characters"
        },
        "independent_variable": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "The one intervention the POC changes"
        },
        "dependent_variables": {
          "type": "string[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Metric ids Benchmark measures. Equals the metrics metric_id set",
          "min_items": 1,
          "max_items": 8
        },
        "baseline_identity": {
          "type": "BaselineIdentity",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Exact unmodified baseline"
        },
        "validation_resource_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Fixed validation data, also in resource_refs"
        },
        "resource_refs": {
          "type": "Ref[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "All captured resources used",
          "min_items": 2
        },
        "environment_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Prepared lock shared by both resource snapshots"
        },
        "metrics": {
          "type": "MetricDeclaration[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Every metric declared once",
          "min_items": 1,
          "max_items": 8
        },
        "outcome_rules": {
          "type": "OutcomeRule[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "One pre-registered rule per declared metric"
        },
        "repeat_count": {
          "type": "integer",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Repetitions per arm",
          "min": 3,
          "max": 30
        },
        "seed": {
          "type": "integer",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Registered seed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 2147483647
        },
        "seed_policy": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Same seed for baseline and treatment in every repeat",
          "enum": [
            "fixed_same_for_all_runs"
          ]
        },
        "implementation_scope": {
          "type": "ImplementationScope",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Limits on what the Builder may write"
        },
        "constraints": {
          "type": "string[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Preserved constraints, contains every Brief constraint text"
        },
        "verification_plan": {
          "type": "string[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Ordered checkable verification steps",
          "min_items": 1,
          "max_items": 12
        }
      },
      "failure": "Missing resources, lock, declared metrics, disjoint numeric rules or conditional rule blocks Builder. Protocol cannot change after the host records the blueprint hash."
    },
    {
      "id": "poc-manifest:field-contract:2",
      "name": "poc-manifest",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "topic": "research-artifacts",
      "producer": "Builder CC (research.builder)",
      "consumers": [
        "Benchmark",
        "checking",
        "Delivery"
      ],
      "document": "capsules/builder.md#poc_manifest",
      "fields": {
        "schema_version": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Format version 2.0.0"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Immutable record identity"
        },
        "blueprint_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Frozen protocol"
        },
        "environment_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Exact unchanged prepared lock"
        },
        "archive_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Bundle zip. sha256 equals the zip bytes hash"
        },
        "files": {
          "type": "NamedFile[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Exactly requirements.txt, poc_patch.py, run_benchmark.py",
          "min_items": 3,
          "max_items": 3
        },
        "dependencies": {
          "type": "Dependency[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Parsed requirements.txt, each exactly pinned",
          "max_items": 50
        }
      },
      "failure": "Missing file, wrong file name, unpinned dependency, bundle hash mismatch or lock mutation blocks. Builder runs no trial and installs nothing."
    },
    {
      "id": "build-receipt:field-contract:1",
      "name": "build-receipt",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "topic": "research-artifacts",
      "producer": "host check bundle for the Builder (protected)",
      "consumers": [
        "Benchmark",
        "checking",
        "Delivery"
      ],
      "document": "capsules/builder.md#build_receipt",
      "fields": {
        "schema_version": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Format version 1.0.0"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Immutable record identity"
        },
        "manifest_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Checked manifest"
        },
        "blueprint_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Frozen protocol"
        },
        "environment_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Prepared lock"
        },
        "archive_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Checked bundle"
        },
        "checker": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Compile and import scan tool names and versions"
        },
        "file_checks": {
          "type": "BuildFileCheck[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "One entry per bundle file",
          "min_items": 3,
          "max_items": 3
        },
        "forbidden_modules_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Forbidden-module list pinned in the check bundle"
        },
        "forbidden_scan_result": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Import scan result across all .py files",
          "enum": [
            "pass",
            "fail"
          ]
        },
        "dependencies": {
          "type": "Dependency[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "All dependencies, fully listed",
          "max_items": 50
        },
        "dependencies_all_pinned": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "True only when every dependency has an exact version"
        },
        "trial_executed": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Must be false. No POC code ran"
        },
        "packages_installed": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Must be false. Nothing was installed"
        },
        "readiness": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Mechanical readiness for Benchmark",
          "enum": [
            "READY",
            "NOT_READY"
          ]
        },
        "readiness_reasons": {
          "type": "string[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Empty when READY, otherwise at least one reason"
        }
      },
      "failure": "NOT_READY or a true trial_executed or packages_installed blocks Benchmark. Build evidence only, never measurements."
    },
    {
      "id": "poc-artifact-bundle:field-contract:1",
      "name": "poc-artifact-bundle",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "topic": "research-artifacts",
      "producer": "Builder CC (research.builder)",
      "consumers": [
        "Benchmark"
      ],
      "document": "capsules/builder.md#poc_artifact_bundle",
      "fields": {
        "archive_format": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Container format",
          "enum": [
            "zip"
          ]
        },
        "entry_names": {
          "type": "string[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Exactly requirements.txt, poc_patch.py, run_benchmark.py",
          "min_items": 3,
          "max_items": 3
        },
        "requirements_txt": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Content of requirements.txt, exact pins only"
        },
        "poc_patch_py": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Content of poc_patch.py, valid syntax, no forbidden import"
        },
        "run_benchmark_py": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Content of run_benchmark.py, valid syntax, no forbidden import"
        }
      },
      "failure": "Wrong entry set, unpinned requirement or forbidden import blocks Benchmark."
    }
  ],
  "types": {
    "ComparisonRule": {
      "fields": {
        "operand": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "The treatment aggregate is what gets compared",
          "enum": [
            "treatment"
          ]
        },
        "comparator": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Comparison",
          "enum": [
            "lt",
            "le",
            "eq",
            "ge",
            "gt"
          ]
        },
        "reference": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "What the treatment aggregate is compared with",
          "enum": [
            "baseline",
            "constant"
          ]
        },
        "factor": {
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Multiplier on the baseline aggregate. 0 for constant, greater than 0 for baseline (cross-field rule checked in output_structure)"
        },
        "offset": {
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Added after the factor, in the metric unit"
        }
      }
    },
    "BaselineIdentity": {
      "fields": {
        "resource_ref": {
          "type": "Ref",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Baseline resource snapshot, one of resource_refs"
        },
        "revision": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Captured immutable revision, equals the snapshot revision"
        },
        "entry_point": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "File in the snapshot that Benchmark runs as the baseline"
        }
      }
    },
    "MetricDeclaration": {
      "fields": {
        "metric_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Unique metric name used downstream",
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$"
        },
        "unit": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Unit of the aggregate"
        },
        "measurement": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Deterministic definition of one repeat value"
        },
        "direction": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Which way is an improvement",
          "enum": [
            "higher_better",
            "lower_better"
          ]
        },
        "aggregation": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "How repeats combine into one aggregate per arm",
          "enum": [
            "median",
            "mean",
            "min",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "target_id": {
          "type": "nullable-string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Brief target_metrics id this metric measures, or null"
        }
      }
    },
    "OutcomeRule": {
      "fields": {
        "metric_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Declared metric the rule decides"
        },
        "success": {
          "type": "ComparisonRule",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Registered success region"
        },
        "falsification": {
          "type": "ComparisonRule",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Registered falsification region, disjoint from success"
        },
        "middle": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Classification for results in neither region",
          "enum": [
            "INCONCLUSIVE",
            "CONDITIONALLY_ACCEPTABLE"
          ]
        },
        "conditional_rule": {
          "type": "nullable-ComparisonRule",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Registered condition for conditional acceptance. Not null exactly when middle is CONDITIONALLY_ACCEPTABLE"
        },
        "conditional_meaning": {
          "type": "nullable-string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Plain meaning of conditional acceptance. Not null exactly when conditional_rule is not null"
        }
      }
    },
    "ImplementationScope": {
      "fields": {
        "may_change": {
          "type": "string[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "What the POC may change",
          "min_items": 1,
          "max_items": 5
        },
        "must_not_change": {
          "type": "string[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Immutable items. Must contain baseline, validation_data, measurement_functions, outcome_rules",
          "min_items": 4
        },
        "max_patch_files": {
          "type": "integer",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Maximum patch files",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        }
      }
    },
    "Dependency": {
      "fields": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Lowercase package name",
          "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9._-]*$"
        },
        "version": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "One exact version, no range or marker",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)*$"
        }
      }
    },
    "BuildFileCheck": {
      "fields": {
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Bundle file checked"
        },
        "sha256": {
          "type": "sha256",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Exact bytes checked"
        },
        "syntax_result": {
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Compile result. not_applicable only for requirements.txt",
          "enum": [
            "pass",
            "fail",
            "not_applicable"
          ]
        },
        "syntax_detail": {
          "type": "nullable-string",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Compiler message, not null when fail"
        },
        "forbidden_imports": {
          "type": "string[]",
          "required": true,
          "meaning": "Forbidden modules or dynamic import uses found"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "examples": [
    {
      "path": "hypothesis_blueprint.json",
      "field_contract_id": "hypothesis-blueprint:field-contract:2",
      "schema_id": null,
      "expect": "valid"
    },
    {
      "path": "hypothesis_blueprint_invalid_undeclared_metric.json",
      "field_contract_id": "hypothesis-blueprint:field-contract:2",
      "schema_id": null,
      "expect": "invalid",
      "rejected_by": "rules_reference_declared_metrics"
    },
    {
      "path": "hypothesis_blueprint_invalid_overlapping_boundaries.json",
      "field_contract_id": "hypothesis-blueprint:field-contract:2",
      "schema_id": null,
      "expect": "invalid",
      "rejected_by": "boundaries_disjoint"
    },
    {
      "path": "poc_manifest.json",
      "field_contract_id": "poc-manifest:field-contract:2",
      "schema_id": null,
      "expect": "valid"
    },
    {
      "path": "poc_manifest_invalid_unpinned_dependency.json",
      "field_contract_id": "poc-manifest:field-contract:2",
      "schema_id": null,
      "expect": "invalid",
      "rejected_by": "dependencies_pinned"
    },
    {
      "path": "poc_manifest_invalid_missing_run_benchmark.json",
      "field_contract_id": "poc-manifest:field-contract:2",
      "schema_id": null,
      "expect": "invalid",
      "rejected_by": "required_files_present"
    },
    {
      "path": "build_receipt.json",
      "field_contract_id": "build-receipt:field-contract:1",
      "schema_id": null,
      "expect": "valid"
    },
    {
      "path": "hypothesis_capsule.json",
      "field_contract_id": null,
      "schema_id": "urn:jiuwenswarm:m1-design:capsule-declaration:1.0.0",
      "expect": "valid"
    },
    {
      "path": "builder_capsule.json",
      "field_contract_id": null,
      "schema_id": "urn:jiuwenswarm:m1-design:capsule-declaration:1.0.0",
      "expect": "valid"
    }
  ],
  "replaces": [
    "hypothesis-blueprint:field-contract:1",
    "poc-manifest:field-contract:1"
  ],
  "contract_index_rows": [
    "| `hypothesis_blueprint` | `hypothesis-blueprint:field-contract:2` | Hypothesis CC | Builder, Benchmark, Evaluation, checking | [hypothesis.md](capsules/hypothesis.md) |",
    "| `poc_manifest` | `poc-manifest:field-contract:2` | Builder CC | Benchmark, checking, Delivery | [builder.md](capsules/builder.md) |",
    "| `poc_artifact_bundle` | `poc-artifact-bundle:field-contract:1` | Builder CC | Benchmark | [builder.md](capsules/builder.md) |",
    "| `build_receipt` | `build-receipt:field-contract:1` | host check bundle for Builder | Benchmark, checking, Delivery | [builder.md](capsules/builder.md) |"
  ],
  "remove_from_shared_pages": [
    "field-catalog.md sections for hypothesis-blueprint v1 and poc-manifest v1, and the MetricRule and ComparisonRule type tables (MetricRule is replaced by MetricDeclaration and OutcomeRule; ComparisonRule gains enums)",
    "other-contracts.md rows for hypothesis_blueprint.json and poc_manifest.json",
    "cc-build-coverage.md Builder row: change 'execution evidence' to 'build evidence (syntax, import scan, dependency pins, readiness)'"
  ],
  "prd_conflicts": [
    "PRD 3.6.4 says smoke validation also checks that output logging format conforms to the JSON schema. M1 build checks do syntax, import scan and pins only. Log format conformance is left to Benchmark, since the Builder runs no code.",
    "PRD 4.9.2 describes the forbidden-module rule as a prompt-level blacklist. This design also enforces it by a host AST scan, which is stricter than the PRD."
  ],
  "open_questions": [
    "Brief comparison value for reference baseline is read as a multiplicative factor (0.9 means 90 percent of baseline). The Requirement owner should confirm, since the Brief schema leaves it unstated.",
    "repeat_count minimum of 3 is a design choice. The PRD gives no number.",
    "boundaries_disjoint probes baseline at 0.001, 1 and 1000 when thresholds depend on the baseline. The Verifier owner may replace this with an exact interval proof.",
    "Forbidden-module list content (six PRD names) is owned by the Verifier owner. Extending it (for example socket, ctypes) is not done.",
    "hypothesis_blueprint.json and poc_manifest.json bytes changed, so benchmark_payload.json and evaluation_verdict.json refs (blueprint_ref, poc_ref) are stale. validate.py loops that read metric success or falsification on blueprint metrics must read outcome_rules instead.",
    "Benchmark must take build_receipt as a required input and require readiness READY. The manifest no longer carries mechanical_evidence_refs.",
    "The existing poc_artifact_bundle.zip requirements.txt has no third-party dependency, so the valid example shows an empty dependencies list."
  ]
}
